However, [[FEAR]] triggered by stepping on an already-active Shaco W cannot be ignored;
Ambessa's R used at the timing when a freshly-placed Shaco W disappears and then activates can ignore it.
However, [[FEAR]] still applies.

When Mordekaiser vanishes from the Rift via R, 
 if Briar's R2 [[DASH]] is already in flight, 
 it arrives at the spot of Mordekaiser's orb as seen from the Rift, and the [[HOMING]] ends. [[CLIP:https://www.youtube.com/shorts/-YBnwcCG-DU]]

While Caitlyn's R [[SKILL_CHANNEL]] is targeting Mounted Kled, 
 if Kled's P [[TRANSFORM]] [[UNTARGETABLE]] turns him Dismounted, 
 Caitlyn's [[SKILL_CHANNEL]] is interrupted.

[[TIP]] When enemy Lissandra uses R on herself to gain [[STASIS]], 
 if you pre-place and activate Caitlyn's W ([[TRAP]]) under her feet, 
 the W ([[TRAP]]) triggers immediately once the [[STASIS]] ends.

[[TIP]] When Caitlyn is on the enemy team against Pantheon, 
 if you place Caitlyn's W ([[TRAP]]) at the center of Pantheon's R landing zone as soon as it's spotted, 
 it activates before Pantheon lands, so he can't avoid it. [[CLIP:https://youtube.com/shorts/4NnnGW_u-hg?feature=share]]

[[TIP]] When enemy Zac gets the P [[REVIVE]] [[STASIS]] effect, 
 if you pre-place and activate Caitlyn's W ([[TRAP]]) at the center where his cells gather, 
 the W ([[TRAP]]) triggers immediately once the [[STASIS]] ends.

[[TIP]] When enemy Zilean gives an ally the R [[REVIVE]] [[STASIS]] effect, 
 if you pre-place and activate Caitlyn's W ([[TRAP]]) under their feet, 
 the W ([[TRAP]]) triggers immediately once the [[STASIS]] ends.
